Comparison of Network Devices
Device	OSI Layer	Forwarding Based On	Collision Domain	Broadcast Domain
Hub	Layer 1	Signal	One (Shared)	One
Bridge	Layer 2	MAC Address	One per Segment	One
Switch	Layer 2	MAC Address	One per Port	One
Router	Layer 3	IP Address	One per Port	One per Interface
